    "2026 change: Paper-I cut from 200 Q / 2 h to 100 Q / 1 h (25 Q per part, 15-minute sectional timer).",
    "2026 change: Paper-II is no longer English-only. It now has four parts: Reasoning, GK/GA and Quant (20 Q each, 40 marks) plus English (100 Q, 200 marks).",
    "NCC bonus on each paper: 'C' certificate 5%, 'B' 3%, 'A' 2% of maximum marks.",
